### 1. 产生一些正常调用，再让下游报错并产生失败调用
POST http://localhost:8081/chaos?mode=NORMAL

###
GET http://localhost:8205/demo/burst?n=5

###
POST http://localhost:8081/chaos?mode=ERROR

###
GET http://localhost:8205/demo/burst?n=10

### 2. 自己记录的事件：能看到 ERROR、STATE_TRANSITION（CLOSED_TO_OPEN）、NOT_PERMITTED
GET http://localhost:8205/demo/events

### 3. Prometheus 格式的指标，搜索 resilience4j_circuitbreaker
GET http://localhost:8205/actuator/prometheus

### 4. 单个指标
GET http://localhost:8205/actuator/metrics/resilience4j.circuitbreaker.state

### 5. 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8205/actuator/health

### 6. Resilience4j 自带的端点（Spring Boot 4 下是否可用，见 README 的实测结果）
GET http://localhost:8205/actuator/circuitbreakers
